1947 kuni 49 juhib meid Ermu Verme

70
00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:18.310
49 kuni 52, Maria Merjanskaja 1952,
Enn Parve 53 kuni 54, Paul Vaarandi.

71
00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:22.190
Ja siis

72
00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.170
